  "notes": "Imported 12.08.2026 from a beamline jcpds collection. Source file(s): JCPDS/dac_user_jcpds/FeH2_tetragonal.jcpds. The I4/mmm structure is from Pepin et al., Phys. Rev. Lett. 113, 265504 (2014), doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.113.265504. Fe was experimentally refined at 67 GPa; the two H sites were obtained by DFT because hydrogen positions could not be determined from the X-ray data. Fractional coordinates are paired here with the legacy reference lattice to enable full-range reflection generation; the legacy peaks are retained.",
